{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13721","headline":"酬本部韦左司 · 顾况","name":"酬本部韦左司","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"好鸟依佳树，飞雨洒高城。\n况与二三子，列坐分两楹。\n文雅一何盛，林塘含余清。\n府君未归朝，游子不待晴。\n白云帝城远，沧江枫叶鸣。\n却略欲一言，零泪和酒倾。\n寸心久摧折，别离重骨惊。\n安得凌风翰，肃肃宾天京。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾况","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13721.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13721","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}